Matrix tile0
Matrix tile1
Matrix tile2
Note zero
Note carry1
Note carry2
Note carry3
Note shape
Note next
Note state
Note output
Label tile0 $U_0,\ldots,U_{n-1}$
Label tile1 $U_n,\ldots,U_{2n-1}$
Label tile2 $U_{2n},\ldots,U_{3n-1}$
Label zero $0$
Label carry1 $C_1$
Label carry2 $C_2$
Label carry3 $C_3$
Label shape $\text{each chunk: }n\text{ updates}\qquad C_0=0$
Label next $C_{c+1}=\alpha^n C_c+\sum_{t=0}^{n-1}\alpha^{n-1-t}U_{cn+t}$
Label state $S_{cn+r}=\alpha^{r+1}C_c+\sum_{t=0}^{r}\alpha^{r-t}U_{cn+t}\quad(0\le r<n)$
Label output $o_{cn+r}=q_{cn+r}^{\top}S_{cn+r}\qquad U_t=k_t v_t^{\top}$
